  FT["MY-H5012"] = {"id":"MY-H5012","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 360/2020&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2020年贷款担保（法人团体）（税收与印花税豁免）（第6号）令","en":"LOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) (REMISSION OF TAX AND STAMP DUTY) (NO. 6) ORDER 2020","orig":"LOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) (REMISSION OF TAX AND STAMP DUTY) (NO. 6) ORDER 2020","ms":"Perintah Jaminan Pinjaman (Badan Korporat) (Remisi Cukai dan Duti Setem) (Bilangan 6) 2020","vi":"Lệnh về Bảo lãnh khoản vay (Pháp nhân) (Giảm miễn thuế và thuế tem) (số 6) năm 2020","th":"คำสั่งการค้ำประกันเงินกู้ (นิติบุคคล) (การงดเว้นภาษีและอากรแสตมป์) (ฉบับที่ 6) ค.ศ. 2020","id":"Perintah Jaminan Pinjaman (Badan Hukum) (Pembebasan Pajak dan Bea Meterai) (Nomor 6) Tahun 2020"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA360","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2020","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 4 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2020_P.U.(A)360-2020_LOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) (REMISSION OF TAX AND STAMP DUTY) (NO. 6) ORDER 2020.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H5012-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Jaminan Pinjaman\n(Pertubuhan Perbadanan) (Peremitan Cukai dan Duti Setem) (No. 6) 2020.\n\n(2)  Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 18 Disember 2020.\n\nPemakaian"}},{"id":"MY-H5012-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah ini hendaklah terpakai bagi—\n\n(a) Nota Jangka Sederhana Islam yang diterbitkan oleh Lembaga Kemajuan\nTanah Persekutuan menurut Program Nota Jangka Sederhana Islam yang\ndisebut \"Program GG Sukuk Murabahah\" dalam Perintah ini, denga n\nnilai nominal sehingga sembilan bilion sembilan ratus juta ringgit\n(RM9,900,000,000.00);\n\n(b) Program GG Sukuk Murabahah dengan nilai nominal sehingga\nsembilan bilion sembilan ratus juta ringgit (RM9,900,000,000.00); dan\n\n(c) jaminan yang diberikan oleh Kerajaan Malaysia yang berhubungan dengan\nProgram GG Sukuk Murabahah.\n\nPeremitan cukai"}},{"id":"MY-H5012-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Apa-apa cukai yang kena dibayar di bawah Akta Cukai Pendapatan 1967\n[Akta 53 ] oleh mana -mana individu atau entiti yang berikut berkenaan dengan apa -apa\nwang yang kena dibayar di bawah apa -apa perjanjian, nota, surat cara dan dokumen\n\nberhubung dengan Program GG Sukuk Murabahah dan jaminan yang disebut dalam\nperenggan 2 hendaklah diremitkan sepenuhnya:\n\n(a) Lembaga Kemajuan Tanah Persekutuan yang baginya Akta terpakai menurut\nPerintah Jaminan Pinjaman (Penetapan Pertubuhan Perbadanan)\n(Lembaga Kemajuan Tanah Persekutuan) 2009 [P.U. (A) 465/2009];\n\n(b) mana-mana pemegang Nota Jangka Sederhana Islam yang diterbitkan oleh\nLembaga Kemajuan Tanah Persekutuan menurut Program GG Sukuk\nMurabahah; atau\n\n (c) mana-mana pihak lain kepada apa -apa perjanjian, nota, surat cara dan\ndokumen berhubung dengan Program GG Sukuk Murabahah atau jaminan yang\ndisebut dalam perenggan 2,  termasuklah mana -mana pihak yang kepadanya\nperjanjian, nota, surat cara atau dokumen itu dipindahkan atau diserahhakkan.\n\nPeremitan duti setem"}},{"id":"MY-H5012-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4.  Apa-apa duti setem yang kena dibayar di bawah Akta Setem 1949 [ Akta 378 ]\nberkenaan dengan apa -apa perjanjian, nota, surat cara dan dokumen berhubung dengan\nProgram GG Sukuk Murabahah dan jaminan yang disebut dalam perenggan 2  hendaklah\ndiremitkan sepenuhnya.\n\nDibuat 14 Disember 2020\n[Perb. MOF.SID(S)700-14/2/12, Jld.4; PN(PU2)232/XVI]\n\nDATO' SRI TENGKU ZAFRUL BIN TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ\nMenteri Kewangan\n\nLOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) ACT 1965\n\nLOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) (REMISSION OF TAX AND STAMP DUTY)\n(NO. 6) ORDER 2020\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 10(1) of the\nLoans Guarantee (Bodies Corporate) Act 1965 [Act 96 ], the Minister makes the\nfollowing order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-10"};
  FT["MY-H5013"] = {"id":"MY-H5013","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 360/2021&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2021年金融服务（豁免）（第2号）令","en":"FINANCIAL SERVICES (EXEMPTION) (NO. 2) ORDER 2021","orig":"FINANCIAL SERVICES (EXEMPTION) (NO. 2) ORDER 2021","ms":"Perintah Perkhidmatan Kewangan (Pengecualian) (Bilangan 2) 2021","vi":"Lệnh về Dịch vụ tài chính (Miễn trừ) (số 2) năm 2021","th":"คำสั่งบริการทางการเงิน (การยกเว้น) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2021","id":"Perintah Jasa Keuangan (Pembebasan) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2021"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA360","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2021","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2021_P.U.(A)360-2021_FINANCIAL SERVICES (EXEMPTION) (NO. 2) ORDER 2021.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H5013-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Perkhidmatan Kewangan\n(Pengecualian) (No. 2) 2021.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 25 Mac 2022.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H5013-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Menteri mengecualikan—\n\n(a) Hydor AS, suatu agensi insurans yang didaftarkan di Norway ,\ndaripada pemakaian perenggan 8(1)(a) Akta bagi maksud\nmenjalankan perniagaan ins urans berkenaan dengan insurans\nperlindungan dan indemniti bagi suatu kapal dengan 30,000 berat tan\nkasar atau kurang bagi tempoh dua tahun; dan\n\n(b) anggota Kumpulan Kelab Perlindungan dan Indemniti\nAntarabangsa (IGP&I) daripada pemakaian perenggan 8(1)(a) Akta\nbagi maksud menjalankan perniagaan insurans berkenaan dengan\ninsurans perlindungan dan indemniti bagi suatu kapal\ndengan 30,000 berat tan kasar atau kurang bagi tempoh dua tahun.\n\n (2) Dalam perenggan ini , \"insurans perlindungan dan indemniti\" ertinya\ninsurans perlindungan dan indemniti yang ditawarkan oleh Hydor AS  atau\nanggota Kumpulan Kelab Perlindungan dan Indemniti  Antarabangsa (IGP&I),\nmengikut mana -mana yang berkenaan,  secara usaha sama dengan\nPerlindungan dan Indemniti Malaysia Sdn. Bhd.\nDibuat 7 September 2021\n[MOF.SID(S)700-1/2/20(SK.6); PN(PU2)718/Jld.6]\n\nTENGKU DATUK SERI UTAMA ZAFRUL BIN TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ                                            TAN SRI DATO' HAJI MAHIADDIN BIN MD YASIN\nMenteri Kewangan                                       Perdana Menteri\n\nFINANCIAL SERVICES ACT 2013\n\nFINANCIAL SERVICES (EXEMPTION) (NO. 2) ORDER 2021\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 263 of the\nFinancial Services Act 2013 [Act 758], the Minister, on the recommendation of the Bank,\nmakes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-10"};
  FT["MY-H5014"] = {"id":"MY-H5014","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 360/2023&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2023年国家技能发展（豁免吉隆坡葛尼训练中心学员费用）条例","en":"NATIONAL SKILLS DEVELOPMENT (WAIVER OF FEE TO TRAINEE AT PUSAT LATIHAN GURNEY, KUALA LUMPUR) REGULATIONS 2023","orig":"NATIONAL SKILLS DEVELOPMENT (WAIVER OF FEE TO TRAINEE AT PUSAT LATIHAN GURNEY, KUALA LUMPUR) REGULATIONS 2023","ms":"Peraturan Pembangunan Kemahiran Kebangsaan (Pelepasan Fi kepada Pelatih di Pusat Latihan Gurney, Kuala Lumpur) 2023","vi":"Quy định về Phát triển kỹ năng quốc gia (Miễn phí cho học viên tại Pusat Latihan Gurney, Kuala Lumpur) năm 2023","th":"ข้อบังคับการพัฒนาทักษะแห่งชาติ (การยกเว้นค่าธรรมเนียมสำหรับผู้เข้าอบรม ณ ศูนย์ฝึกเกอร์นีย์ กัวลาลัมเปอร์) ค.ศ. 2023","id":"Peraturan Pengembangan Keterampilan Nasional (Pembebasan Biaya bagi Peserta di Pusat Latihan Gurney, Kuala Lumpur) Tahun 2023"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA360","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2023","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2023_P.U.(A)360-2023_NATIONAL SKILLS DEVELOPMENT (WAIVER OF FEE TO TRAINEE AT PUSAT LATIHAN GURNEY, KUALA LUMPUR) RE.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H5014-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\n\nPembangunan Kemahiran Kebangsaan (Penepian Fi kepada Pelatih\n\ndi Pusat Latihan Gurney, Kuala Lumpur) 2023.\n\n(2) Peraturan-Peraturan ini disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa\n\npada 1 Julai 2022.\n\nPenepian fi"}},{"id":"MY-H5014-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Tertakluk kepada subperaturan (2), fi yang ditetapkan dalam\n\nsubsubsubbutiran 1(a)(i)(A) Jadual Kedua kepada Peraturan-Peraturan Pembangunan\n\nKemahiran Kebangsaan (Fi dan Caj) 2016 [P.U. (A) 86/2016] diketepikan berkenaan\n\ndengan seseorang pelatih warganegara yang memohon bagi pengiktirafan kemahiran\n\nyang membawa kepada penganugerahan Sijil Kemahiran Malaysia melalui\n\nPusat Latihan Gurney, Kuala Lumpur.\n\n(2) Penepian fi di bawah subperaturan (1) adalah terpakai bagi permohonan\n\npengiktirafan kemahiran yang dibuat dalam tempoh tiga tahun mulai 1 Julai 2022\n\nhingga 30 Jun 2025.\n\nDibuat 14 November 2023\n\n[KSM/PUU(S)600-1/2/16/1; PN(PU2)655/JLD. 6]\n\nSIVAKUMAR A/L VARATHARAJU NAIDU\n\nMenteri Sumber Manusia\n\nNATIONAL SKILLS DEVELOPMENT ACT 2006\n\nNATIONAL SKILLS DEVELOPMENT (WAIVER OF FEE TO TRAINEE\n\nAT PUSAT LATIHAN GURNEY, KUALA LUMPUR) REGULATIONS 2023\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 72(2)(d)\n\nof the National Skills Development Act 2006 [Act 652], the Minister makes\n\nthe following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-10"};
  FT["MY-H5015"] = {"id":"MY-H5015","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 360/2024&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2024年关税（禁止进口）（修正）（第4号）令","en":"CUSTOMS (PROHIBITION OF IMPORTS) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 4) ORDER 2024","orig":"CUSTOMS (PROHIBITION OF IMPORTS) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 4) ORDER 2024","ms":"Perintah Kastam (Larangan Import) (Pindaan) (Bilangan 4) 2024","vi":"Lệnh về Hải quan (Cấm nhập khẩu) (Sửa đổi) (số 4) năm 2024","th":"คำสั่งศุลกากร (การห้ามนำเข้า) (การแก้ไข) (ฉบับที่ 4) ค.ศ. 2024","id":"Perintah Kepabeanan (Larangan Impor) (Perubahan) (Nomor 4) Tahun 2024"},"level":"regulation","category":"03_涉外投资与贸易","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA360","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2024","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 5 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\03_涉外投资与贸易\\2024_P.U.(A)360-2024_CUSTOMS (PROHIBITION OF IMPORTS) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 4) ORDER 2024.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H5015-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kastam (Larangan Mengenai\n\nImport) (Pindaan) (No. 4) 2024.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Disember 2024.\n\nPindaan perenggan 4"}},{"id":"MY-H5015-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Kastam (Larangan Mengenai Import) 2023 [P.U. (A) 117/2023],\n\nyang disebut \"Perintah ibu\" dalam Perintah ini, dipinda dalam subperenggan 4(2)\n\ndengan menggantikan perkataan \"dan Pangkor\" dengan perkataan \", Pangkor dan Pulau 1\".\n\nPindaan perenggan 5"}},{"id":"MY-H5015-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Subperenggan 5(3) Perintah ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan\n\n\"dan Pangkor\" dengan perkataan \", Pangkor dan Pulau 1\".\n\nPindaan perenggan 8"}},{"id":"MY-H5015-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Subperenggan 8(3) Perintah ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan\n\n\"dan Pangkor\" dengan perkataan \", Pangkor dan Pulau 1\".\n\nPindaan perenggan 11"}},{"id":"MY-H5015-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. Subperenggan 11(3) Perintah ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan\n\n\"dan Pangkor\" dengan perkataan \", Pangkor dan Pulau 1\".\n\nDibuat 20 November 2024\n\n[SULIT KE.HD(122)860/02Klt.8(3); PN(PU2)338/JLD.75]\n\nDATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH AZIZAN\n\n Menteri Kewangan II\n\nCUSTOMS ACT 1967\n\nCUSTOMS (PROHIBITION OF IMPORTS) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 4) ORDER 2024\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 31(1) of the\n\nCustoms Act 1967 [Act 235], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-10"};
  FT["MY-H5016"] = {"id":"MY-H5016","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 360/2025&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2025年所得税（业务搬迁成本扣除）（森林城市特别金融区第一岛）规则","en":"INCOME TAX (DEDUCTION OF COST FOR RELOCATION OF BUSINESS) (PULAU 1 OF FOREST CITY SPECIAL FINANCIAL ZONE) RULES 2025","orig":"INCOME TAX (DEDUCTION OF COST FOR RELOCATION OF BUSINESS) (PULAU 1 OF FOREST CITY SPECIAL FINANCIAL ZONE) RULES 2025","ms":"Kaedah Cukai Pendapatan (Potongan Kos Pemindahan Perniagaan) (Pulau 1 Zon Kewangan Khas Forest City) 2025","vi":"Quy tắc về Thuế thu nhập (Khấu trừ chi phí di dời cơ sở kinh doanh) (Đảo 1 thuộc Khu tài chính đặc biệt Forest City) năm 2025","th":"กฎภาษีเงินได้ (การหักต้นทุนการย้ายสถานประกอบการ) (เกาะ 1 ของเขตการเงินพิเศษ Forest City) ค.ศ. 2025","id":"Tata Tertib Pajak Penghasilan (Pengurangan Biaya Relokasi Usaha) (Pulau 1 Kawasan Keuangan Khusus Forest City) Tahun 2025"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA360","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2025","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 4 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2025_P.U.(A)360-2025_INCOME TAX (DEDUCTION OF COST FOR RELOCATION OF BUSINESS) (PULAU 1 OF FOREST CITY SPECIAL FINAN.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H5016-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1)  Kaedah-kaedah ini bolehlah dinamakan Kaedah-Kaedah\nCukai P endapatan (Potongan Kos bagi Penempatan Semula  Perniagaan)\n(Pulau 1 Zon Kewangan Khas Forest City) 2025.\n\n(2) Kaedah-Kaedah ini disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa\npada 1 September 2024.\n\nTafsiran"}},{"id":"MY-H5016-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Dalam Kaedah-Kaedah ini—\n\n  \"orang yang layak\" ertinya orang yang layak sebagaimana yang diperuntukkan\ndi bawah kaedah 3;\n\n  \"Pulau 1  Zon Kewangan Khas Forest City \" ertinya Pulau 1 , Forest City yang\nterletak di Mukim Tanjung Kupang, Daerah Johor Bahru, Johor se bagaimana yang\nditunjukkan dalam Pelan Warta PW50276 yang disimpan di Pejabat Pengarah Ukur dan\nPemetaan, Johor.\n\nOrang yang layak"}},{"id":"MY-H5016-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. (1) Orang yang layak ialah—\n\n(a) orang yang dilesenkan di bawah seksyen 10\nAkta Perkhidmatan Kewangan 2013 [Akta 758 ] atau seksyen 10\nAkta Perkhidmatan Kewangan Islam 2013 [Akta 759];\n\n(b) syarikat yang merupakan pemegang Lesen Perkhidmatan Pasaran\nModal di bawah Akta Pasaran Modal dan Perkhidmatan 2007\n[Akta 671];\n\n(c) pengendali pasaran diiktiraf yang didaftarkan di bawah seksyen 34\nAkta Pasaran Modal dan Perkhidmatan 2007 selain seorang\nindividu;\n\n(d) orang berdaftar yang didaftarkan di bawah seksyen 76\nAkta Pasaran Modal dan Perkhidmatan 2007 selain seorang\nindividu;\n\n(e) orang yang menyediakan perkhidmatan pasaran modal yang\ndidaftarkan di bawah seksyen 76 A Akta Pasaran Modal dan\nPerkhidmatan 2007 selain seorang individu;\n\n(f) syarikat dana keluarga tunggal yang ditentusahkan oleh\nSuruhanjaya Sekuriti;\n\n(g) syarikat teknologi kewangan, syarikat teknologi insurans,\nsyarikat pengawalseliaan teknologi kewangan atau syarikat\nteknologi kewangan Islam  yang dianugerahkan Status MSC\nMalaysia atau Status Malaysia Digital dan ditentusahkan oleh\nMalaysia Digital Economy Corporation Sdn. Bhd.;\n\n(h) pengendali sistem pembayaran yang ditubuhkan atau\ndiperbadankan dalam suatu bidang kuasa asing yang diluluskan\ndi bawah seksyen 11 Akta Perkhidmatan Kewangan 2013 atau\nseksyen 11 Akta Perkhidmatan Kewangan Islam 2013 untuk\nmengendalikan suatu sistem pembayaran di Pulau 1\nZon Kewangan Khas Forest City; atau\n\n(i) entiti perkhidmatan berpusat yang menyediakan perkhidmatan\nperniagaan global kewangan yang dianugerahkan Status MSC\nMalaysia atau Status Malaysia Digital dan ditentusahkan oleh\nMalaysia Digital Economy Corporation Sdn. Bhd.\n\n(2) Syarikat dana keluarga tunggal yang disebut dalam\nperenggan (1)(f) ialah suatu syarikat yang—\n\n(a) diperbadankan di bawah Akta Syarikat 2016 [ Akta 777 ] dan\nbermastautin di Malaysia;\n\n(b) dimiliki sepenuhnya, secara langsung atau tidak langsung,\noleh anggota suatu keluarga tunggal;\n\n(c) beroperasi di Pulau 1 Zon Kewangan Khas Forest City; dan\n\n(d) ditubuhkan semata-mata bagi maksud memegang aset dan aktiviti\npelaburan bagi kepentingan anggota suatu keluarga tunggal.\n\n(3) Bagi maksud kaedah ini , \"keluarga tunggal\" ertinya suatu keluarga yang\nanggotanya ialah individu yang mempunyai pertalian nasab langsung daripada\nnenek moyang tunggal dan termasuklah—\n\n(a) suami atau isteri;\n\n(b) anak kandung;\n\n(c) anak tiri; dan\n\n(d) anak yang diambil menjadi anak angkat mengikut mana -mana\nundang-undang bertulis.\n\nPotongan"}},{"id":"MY-H5016-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. (1)  Bagi maksud menentukan pendapatan larasan orang yang layak daripada\nperniagaannya dalam tempoh asas bagi suatu tahun taksiran, suatu potongan hendaklah\ndibenarkan bagi kos bagi penempatan semula perniagaan sebagaimana yang dinyatakan\ndalam Jadual  yang dilakukan oleh orang yang layak itu untuk menempatkan semula\nperniagaannya di Pulau 1 Zon Kewangan Khas Forest City.\n\n(2) Kos bagi penempatan semula perniagaan yang disebut dalam\nsubkaedah (1) adalah tertakluk kepada syarat yang berikut:\n\n(a) penempatan semula  perniagaan itu di buat dalam tempoh\nmulai 1 September 2024 hingga 31 Disember 2034;\n\n(b) kos bagi penempatan semula perniagaan itu hendaklah disifatkan\ntelah dilakukan pada tahun taksiran yang orang yang layak itu mula\nmenjalankan semua atau sebahagian daripada perniagaannya\ndi Pulau 1 Zon Kewangan Khas Forest City; dan\n\n(c) kos bagi penempatan semula  perniagaan itu diperakui oleh\njuruaudit luar.\n\n(3) Potongan di bawah subkaedah (1) tidak boleh melebihi\nlima ratus ribu ringgit.\n\nJADUAL\n\n           [Kaedah 4]\n\n(1)\nBil.\n(2)\nKos bagi Penempatan Semula Perniagaan\n\n1. Apa-apa kos yang dilakukan bagi perancangan, pelaksanaan atau penyeliaan\npenempatan semula perniagaan\n\n(1)\nBil.\n(2)\nKos bagi Penempatan Semula Perniagaan\n\n2. Pembungkusan atau pengeluaran (bahan atau caj buruh)\n\n3. Pengangkutan\n\n4. Premium insurans bagi maksud penempatan semula perniagaan\n\n5. Penggudangan\n\nDibuat 30 September 2025\n[MOF.TAX(S)700-2/7/1314/3; LHDN.AY.A 600-12/1/7(29)-458; PN(PU2)80/JLD. 114]\n\n                                              DATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH AZIZAN\n                                                   Menteri Kewangan II\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 154(2)\nAkta Cukai Pendapatan 1967]\n\nINCOME TAX ACT 1967\n\nINCOME TAX (DEDUCTION OF COST FOR RELOCATION OF BUSINESS)\n(PULAU 1 OF FOREST CITY SPECIAL FINANCIAL ZONE) RULES 2025\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 154(1) (b)\nof the Income Tax Act 1967 [ Act 53 ] read together with paragraph 33(1)(d) of the Act ,\nthe Minister makes the following rules:\n\nCitation and commencement\n1. (1)  These rules may be cited as the Income Tax ( Deduction of Cost for\nRelocation of Business) (Pulau 1 of Forest City Special Financial Zone) Rules 2025.\n\n(2)  These Rules are deemed to have come into operation on 1 September 2024.\n\nInterpretation\n2. In these Rules—\n\n\"qualifying person\" means a qualifying person as provided for under rule 3;\n\n\"Pulau 1 of Forest City Special Financial Zone\" means Pulau 1, Forest City situated in\nthe Mukim of Tanjung Kupang, District of Johor Bahru, Johore as shown in the Gazette Plan\nPW50276 deposited in the Office of the Director of Survey and Mapping, Johore.\n\nQualifying person\n3. (1) A qualifying person is—\n\n(a) a person who is licensed under section 10 of the\nFinancial Services Act 2013 [ Act 758 ] or section 10 of the\nIslamic Financial Services Act 2013 [Act 759];\n\n(b) a company which is a holder of a Capital Market Services Licence under\nthe Capital Markets and Services Act 2007 [Act 671];\n\n(c) a recognized market operator who is registered under section 34\nof the Capital Markets and Services Act 2007 other than an individual;\n\n(d) a registered person registered under section 76 of the\nCapital Markets and Services Act 2007 other than an individual;\n\n(e) a person providing capital market services registered under\nsection 76A of the Capital Markets and Services Act 2007 other than\nan individual;\n\n(f) a single family fund company which is verified by the\nSecurities Commission;\n\n(g) a financial technology company, insurance technology company,\nregulatory financial technology company or Islamic financial\ntechnology company which has been awarded MSC Malaysia Status or\nMalaysia Digital Status and is verified by Malaysia Digital Economy\nCorporation Sdn. Bhd.;\n\n(h) a payment system operator established or incorporated in\na foreign jurisdiction approved under section 11 of the\nFinancial Services Act 2013 or  section 11 of  the\nIslamic Financial Services Act 2013 to operate a payment system in\nPulau 1 of Forest City Special Financial Zone; or\n\n(i) a centralized services entity providing financial global business\nservices which has been awarded MSC Malaysia Status or\nMalaysia Digital Status and is verified by Malaysia Digital Economy\nCorporation Sdn. Bhd.\n\n(2) The single family  fund company referred to in  paragraph ( 1)(f)\nis a company which—\n\n(a) is incorporated under the Companies Act 2016 [ Act 777 ] and\nresident in Malaysia;\n\n(b) is wholly owned, directly or indirectly, by a member of a single family;\n\n(c) operates in Pulau 1 of Forest City Special Financial Zone; and\n\n(d) is established solely for the purpose of holding the asset and\ninvestment activity for the interest of members of a single family.\n\n(3)  For the purposes of this rule, \"single family\" means a family whose members\nare individuals who are lineal descendants of a single ancestor and includes—\n\n(a) the spouse;\n\n(b) the biological child;\n\n(c) the stepchild; and\n\n(d) the child adopted in accordance with any written law.\n\nDeduction\n4. (1) For the purpose of ascertaining the adjusted income of a qualifying person\nfrom its business in the basis period for a year of assessment, a deduction shall be allowed\nfor the cost for relocation of business as specified in the Schedule  incurred by the\nqualifying person to relocate its business in Pulau 1 of Forest City Special Financial Zone.\n\n(2) The c ost for relocation of business referred to in subrule (1) is subject to\nthe following conditions:\n\n(a) the relocation of business takes place  within the period\nfrom 1 September 2024 to 31 December 2034;\n\n(b) the cost for relocation of business shall be deemed to be incurred in\nthe year of assessment in which the qualifying person commences\nto undertake the whole or part of its business in Pulau 1  Forest City\nSpecial Financial Zone; and\n\n(c) the cost for relocation of business is certified by an external auditor.\n\n(3) The deduction under subrule (1) shall  not excee d\nfive hundred thousand ringgit.\n\n                SCHEDULE\n\n               [Rule 4]\n\n(1)\nNo.\n(2)\nCost for Relocation of Business\n\n1. Any cost incurred for planning, execution or supervision of the relocation\nof business\n\n2. Packing or unpacking (materials or labour charges)\n\n3. Transportation\n\n4. Insurance premium for the purposes of relocation of business\n\n5. Warehousing\n\nMade 30 September 2025\n[MOF.TAX(S)700-2/7/1314/3; LHDN.AY.A 600-12/1/7(29)-458; PN(PU2)80/JLD. 114]\n\n                                              DATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH AZIZAN\n                                                           Minister of Finance II\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to subsection 154(2) of the\nIncome Tax Act 1967]"}}],"pack":"my-10"};
  FT["MY-H5017"] = {"id":"MY-H5017","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 360/2026&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2026年重量限制（联邦道路）（修正）（第8号）令","en":"WEIGHT RESTRICTIONS (FEDERAL ROADS) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 8) ORDER 2026","orig":"WEIGHT RESTRICTIONS (FEDERAL ROADS) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 8) ORDER 2026","ms":"Perintah Sekatan Berat (Jalan Raya Persekutuan) (Pindaan) (Bilangan 8) 2026","vi":"Lệnh về Giới hạn trọng lượng (Đường bộ liên bang) (Sửa đổi) (số 8) năm 2026","th":"คำสั่งการจำกัดน้ำหนัก (ทางหลวงสหพันธ์) (การแก้ไข) (ฉบับที่ 8) ค.ศ. 2026","id":"Perintah Pembatasan Berat (Jalan Raya Federal) (Perubahan) (Nomor 8) Tahun 2026"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA360","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2026","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2026_P.U.(A)360-2026_WEIGHT RESTRICTIONS (FEDERAL ROADS) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 8) ORDER 2026.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H5017-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Sekatan Berat\n\n(Jalan Persekutuan) (Pindaan) (No. 8) 2026.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 15 Oktober 2026.\n\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H5017-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Sekatan Berat (Jalan Persekutuan) 1989 [P.U. (A) 478/1989] yang disebut\n\n\"Perintah ibu\" dalam Perintah ini, dipinda dalam Jadual Pertama—\n\n(a) dalam kepala, dengan menggantikan perkataan \"BEBAN RODA\n\nMAKSIMUM, BEBAN GANDAR MAKSIMUM, BEBAN GANDAR IRING\n\nDENGAN DUA GANDAR MAKSIMUM DAN BEBAN GANDAR IRING DENGAN\n\nTIGA GANDAR MAKSIMUM (TAN)\" dengan perkataan \"BEBAN RODA\n\nMAKSIMUM, BEBAN GANDAR MAKSIMUM, BEBAN GANDAR IRING\n\nDENGAN DUA GANDAR MAKSIMUM, BEBAN GANDAR IRING DENGAN\n\nTIGA GANDAR MAKSIMUM DAN BEBAN GANDAR IRING DENGAN EMPAT\n\nGANDAR MAKSIMUM (TAN)\";\n\n(b) di bawah kepala JENIS BEBAN, berhubung dengan subsubbutiran\n\n2. Gandar beroda empat, dengan memasukkan selepas subsubsubbutiran\n\n\"Beban gandar iring dengan tiga gandar jika rebak gandar ialah:\" dan\n\nbutir-butir yang berhubungan dengannya subsubsubbutiran dan butir-butir\n\nyang berikut:\n\n; dan\n\nJENIS BEBAN Jalan-jalan\n\nPersekutuan\n\nyang\n\ndinyatakan\n\ndalam\n\nSenarai I\n\nJadual Kedua\n\nJalan-jalan\n\nPersekutuan\n\nyang\n\ndinyatakan\n\ndalam\n\nSenarai II\n\nJadual Kedua\n\nJalan-jalan\n\nPersekutuan\n\nyang\n\ndinyatakan\n\ndalam\n\nSenarai III\n\nJadual Kedua\n\nJalan-jalan\n\nPersekutuan\n\nyang\n\ndinyatakan\n\ndalam\n\nSenarai IV\n\nJadual Kedua\n\nJalan-jalan\n\nPersekutuan\n\nyang\n\ndinyatakan\n\ndalam\n\nSenarai I\n\nhingga IV\n\nJadual Kedua\n\nTatarajah Gandar Rebak Gandar\n\n(meter)\n\n\"Beban gandar iring\n\ndengan empat gandar\n\njika rebak gandar ialah:\n\nSekurang-kurangnya\n\n3.9 m\n\n28 - - - -\"\n\n(c) di bawah kepala JENIS KENDERAAN, dengan memasukkan selepas subbutiran 6-Gandar dan butir-butir yang\n\nberhubungan dengannya subbutiran dan butir-butir yang berikut:\n\nJENIS KENDERAAN Jalan-jalan\n\nPersekutuan\n\nyang\n\ndinyatakan\n\ndalam\n\nSenarai I\n\nJadual Kedua\n\nJalan-jalan\n\nPersekutuan\n\nyang\n\ndinyatakan\n\ndalam\n\nSenarai II\n\nJadual Kedua\n\nJalan-jalan\n\nPersekutuan\n\nyang\n\ndinyatakan\n\ndalam\n\nSenarai III\n\nJadual Kedua\n\nJalan-jalan\n\nPersekutuan\n\nyang\n\ndinyatakan\n\ndalam\n\nSenarai IV\n\nJadual Kedua\n\nJalan-jalan\n\nPersekutuan\n\nyang\n\ndinyatakan\n\ndalam\n\nSenarai I\n\nhingga IV\n\nJadual Kedua\n\nTatarajah Gandar Jarak Roda\n\n(meter)\n\n\"7-Gandar Kurang daripada 9.1 m 43 - - - -\n\nSekurang-kurangnya\n\n9.1 m\n\n45 - - - -\n\nSekurang-kurangnya\n\n10.0 m\n\n47 - - - -\n\nSekurang-kurangnya\n\n11.0 m\n\n49 - - - -\n\nSekurang-kurangnya\n\n12.2 m\n\n51 - - - -\n\nSekurang-kurangnya\n\n13.1 m\n\n53 - - - -\".\n\nPindaan Jadual Keempat"}},{"id":"MY-H5017-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Perintah ibu dipinda dalam Jadual Keempat dengan memotong butiran 6.\n\nDibuat 13 Oktober 2026\n\n[KKR.PUU.110-1/6/16 Jld.2 ; PN(PU2)460/JLD.143]\n\nDATO' SRI ALEXANDER NANTA LINGGI\n\nMenteri Kerja Raya\n\nROAD TRANSPORT ACT 1987\n\nWEIGHT RESTRICTIONS (FEDERAL ROADS) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 8) ORDER 2026\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 70(1) of the Road Transport Act 1987\n\n[Act 333], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-10"};
  FT["MY-H5018"] = {"id":"MY-H5018","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 361/2011&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2011年关税（计价）（棕榈油）（第44号）令","en":"CUSTOMS (VALUES) (PALM OIL) (NO. 44) ORDER 2011","orig":"CUSTOMS (VALUES) (PALM OIL) (NO. 44) ORDER 2011","ms":"Perintah Kastam (Nilai) (Minyak Sawit) (Bilangan 44) 2011","vi":"Lệnh về Hải quan (Trị giá) (Dầu cọ) (số 44) năm 2011","th":"คำสั่งศุลกากร (มูลค่า) (น้ำมันปาล์ม) (ฉบับที่ 44) ค.ศ. 2011","id":"Perintah Kepabeanan (Nilai) (Minyak Kelapa Sawit) (Nomor 44) Tahun 2011"},"level":"regulation","category":"03_涉外投资与贸易","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA361","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2011","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\03_涉外投资与贸易\\2011_P.U.(A)361-2011_CUSTOMS (VALUES) (PALM OIL) (NO. 44) ORDER 2011.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H5018-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kastam (Nilai -Nilai)\n(Minyak Kelapa Sawit) (No. 44) 2011 dan hendaklah mula berkuat kuasa bagi tempoh\ndari 31 Oktober 2011 hingga 6 November 2011.\n\nPemungutan dan pembayaran duti kastam"}},{"id":"MY-H5018-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Bagi maksud pemungutan dan pembayaran duti -duti kastam, menurut\nperuntukan-peruntukan Perintah Duti Kastam 2007 [ P.U. (A) 441/2007], nilai bagi tiap -\ntiap satu barang berduti yang din yatakan dalam ruang (1) dan (2) Jadual mengikut\nunitnya yang tersebut dalam ruang (3) hendaklah nilai yang dinyatakan dalam\nruang (4).\n\nCUSTOMS ACT 1967\n\nCUSTOMS (VALUES) (PALM OIL) (NO. 44) ORDER 2011\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 12 of the Customs Act 1967 [Act 235], the\nMinister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\nJADUAL/SCHEDULE\nBarang\n(Goods)\n(1)\n\nSubkepala\n(Subheading)\n(2)\nUnit\n(Unit)\n(3)\nNilai\n(Value)\n(4)\nCrude Palm Oil 1511.10 100 tonne RM2,862.43\n\nDibuat    28 Oktober 2011\nMade      28 October 2011\n[KE.HT(94)819/03-6/KLT. 10(54); Perb.(8.20)116/1-4; PN(PU2)338/XXIX]\n\n          Dengan arahan Menteri Kewangan/\n          By direction of the Minister of Finance\n\n    Bagi pihak dan atas nama Menteri Kewangan/\n          On behalf and in the name of the Minister of Finance\n\n YAP SOO HAR\n    Timbalan Setiausaha/\nDeputy Under Secretary\nBahagian Analisa Cukai/\nTax Analysis Division"}}],"pack":"my-10"};
  FT["MY-H5019"] = {"id":"MY-H5019","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 361/2012&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2012年贷款担保（法人团体宣告）（图鲁斯飞机私人有限公司）令","en":"LOANS GUARANTEE (DECLARATION OF BODIES CORPORATE) (TURUS PESAWAT SDN. BHD.) ORDER 2012","orig":"LOANS GUARANTEE (DECLARATION OF BODIES CORPORATE) (TURUS PESAWAT SDN. BHD.) ORDER 2012","ms":"Perintah Jaminan Pinjaman (Pengisytiharan Badan Korporat) (Turus Pesawat Sdn. Bhd.) 2012","vi":"Lệnh về Bảo lãnh khoản vay (Tuyên bố pháp nhân) (Turus Pesawat Sdn. Bhd.) năm 2012","th":"คำสั่งการค้ำประกันเงินกู้ (การประกาศนิติบุคคล) (บริษัท Turus Pesawat Sdn. Bhd.) ค.ศ. 2012","id":"Perintah Jaminan Pinjaman (Penetapan Badan Hukum) (Turus Pesawat Sdn. Bhd.) Tahun 2012"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA361","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2012","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2012_P.U.(A)361-2012_LOANS GUARANTEE (DECLARATION OF BODIES CORPORATE) (TURUS PESAWAT SDN. BHD.) ORDER 2012.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H5019-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Jaminan Pinjaman\n\n(Penetapan Pertubuhan Perbadanan) (Turus Pesawat Sdn. Bhd.) 2012.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 8 November 2012.\n\nPenetapan pemakaian Akta"}},{"id":"MY-H5019-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pertubuhan perbadanan yang dikenali sebagai Turus Pesawat Sdn. Bhd.\n\nditetapkan sebagai suatu pertubuhan perbadanan yang baginya Akta terpakai.\n\nDibuat 24 Oktober 2012\n\n[KK/BPKA/M/(S)/393/692/1; PN(PU2)232/VIII]\n\n DATO' SERI HAJI AHMAD HUSNI BIN MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\n\n Menteri Kewangan Kedua\n\nLOANS GUARANTEE (BODIES CORPORATE) ACT 1965\n\nLOANS GUARANTEE (DECLARATION OF BODIES CORPORATE) (TURUS PESAWAT\n\nSDN. BHD.) ORDER 2012\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 3 of the Loans Guarantee\n\n(Bodies Corporate) Act 1965 [Act 96], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-10"};
  FT["MY-H502"] = {"id":"MY-H502","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-detail.php?act=635&lang=BI","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2004年费用（马来西亚海洋公园）（追认）法","en":"FEES (MARINE PARKS MALAYSIA) (VALIDATION) ACT 2004","orig":"FEES (MARINE PARKS MALAYSIA) (VALIDATION) ACT 2004","vi":"Luật về Phí (Các vườn quốc gia biển Malaysia) (Sự xác nhận hiệu lực) năm 2004","th":"พระราชบัญญัติค่าธรรมเนียม (อุทยานทางทะเลมาเลเซีย) (การรับรอง) ค.ศ. 2004","id":"Undang-Undang Biaya (Taman Laut Malaysia) (Pengesahan) Tahun 2004","ms":"Akta Fi (Taman Laut Malaysia) (Pengesahan) 2004"},"level":"law","category":"03_涉外投资与贸易","status":"active","docNumber":"ACT635","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2004","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\03_涉外投资与贸易\\2004_635_FEES (MARINE PARKS MALAYSIA) (VALIDATION) ACT 2004.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H502-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. This Act may be cited as the Fees (Marine Parks Malaysia)\n(Validation) Act 2004.\nValidation and indemnity"}},{"id":"MY-H502-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. (1) Notwithstanding the provisions of the Fees Act 1951\n[Act 209], the fees which were charged and collected by the Fisheries\nDepartment Malaysia in respect of any entrance to any Marine\nPark Malaysia during the period from 1 January 1999 to\n17 July 2003, being the day before the date of coming into force\nLAWS OF MALAYSIA\nAct 635\nFEES (MARINE PARKS MALAYSIA) (VALIDATION)\nACT 2004\nLaws of Malaysia4 ACT 635\nof the Fees (Marine Parks Malaysia) Order 2003 [P.U. (A) 266/2003],\nshall be deemed to have been validly charged and collected.\n(2) No action or legal proceeding shall be brought, instituted\nor maintained against the Government of Malaysia or any officer\nof the Government of Malaysia or any person acting under them\nin respect of any fees which were charged and collected, and if\nany such action or legal proceeding has been brought, instituted\nor maintained, it shall be discharged and made void and no refund\nin respect of the fees charged and collected as stated in this Act\nshall be made.\nDICETAK OLEH\nPERCETAKAN NASIONAL MALAYSIA BERHAD,\nCAW ANGAN KUALA LUMPUR\nBAGI PIHAK DAN DENGAN PERINTAH KERAJAAN MALAYSIA"}}],"pack":"my-10"};
  FT["MY-H5020"] = {"id":"MY-H5020","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 361/2013&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2013年所得税（豁免）（第14号）令","en":"INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 14) ORDER 2013","orig":"INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 14) ORDER 2013","ms":"Perintah Cukai Pendapatan (Pengecualian) (Bilangan 14) 2013","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế thu nhập (Miễn trừ) (số 14) năm 2013","th":"คำสั่งภาษีเงินได้ (การยกเว้น) (ฉบับที่ 14) ค.ศ. 2013","id":"Perintah Pajak Penghasilan (Pembebasan) (Nomor 14) Tahun 2013"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA361","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2013","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2013_P.U.(A)361-2013_INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 14) ORDER 2013.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H5020-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1.  (1)  Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Cukai Pendapatan\n(Pengecualian) (No. 14) 2013.\n\n(2)   Perintah ini terpakai bagi tahun taksiran 2013.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H5020-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2.  (1)  Menteri mengecualikan individu pemastautin di Malaysia  daripada\npembayaran cukai pendapatan dalam tempoh asas bagi tahun taksiran berkenaan\ndengan pendapatan yang boleh dikenakan cukai dengan syarat jumlah pendapatan\nagregat individu it u dalam tempoh asas bagi tahun taksiran itu hendaklah tidak\nmelebihi sembilan puluh enam ribu ringgit.\n\n (2)   Amaun pendapatan yang boleh dikenakan cukai  yang dikecualikan\ndi bawah subperenggan (1) ialah dua ribu ringgit.\n\nDibuat 12 Disember 2013\n[Perb. CR(8.09)294/6/4-9(SJ.10)(2013); LHDN.01/35/(S)/42/51/231-17.15;\nPN(PU2)80/LXXIII]\n\nDATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\n Menteri Kewangan Kedua\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 127(4) Akta Cukai Pendapatan\n1967]\n\nINCOME TAX ACT 1967\n\nINCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 14) ORDER 2013\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 127(3)(b) of the Income Tax Act 1967\n[Act 53], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and application"}}],"pack":"my-10"};
  FT["MY-H5021"] = {"id":"MY-H5021","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 361/2014&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2014年印花税（豁免）（第2号）令","en":"STAMP DUTY (REMISSION) (NO. 2) ORDER 2014","orig":"STAMP DUTY (REMISSION) (NO. 2) ORDER 2014","ms":"Perintah Duti Setem (Remisi) (Bilangan 2) 2014","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế tem (Giảm miễn) (số 2) năm 2014","th":"คำสั่งอากรแสตมป์ (การงดเว้น) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2014","id":"Perintah Bea Meterai (Pembebasan) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2014"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA361","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2014","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2014_P.U.(A)361-2014_STAMP DUTY (REMISSION) (NO. 2) ORDER 2014.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H5021-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1.  (1)   Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Duti Setem (Peremitan)\n(No. 2) 2014.\n\n (2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Januari 2015.\n\nPeremitan"}},{"id":"MY-H5021-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Hendaklah diremitkan sebanyak l ima puluh peratus  daripada duti setem\nyang dikenakan  ke atas mana -mana surat cara pindah milik bagi pembelian satu unit\nharta kediaman sahaja yang bernilai tidak melebihi lima ratus ribu ringgit\n(RM500,000.00) oleh seorang individu warganegara Malaysia dengan syarat bahawa—\n\n(a) perjanjian jual beli bagi pembelian harta kediaman itu\ndisempurnakan pada atau selepas 1 Januari 2015 tetapi tidak\nlewat daripada 31 Disember 2016; dan\n\n(b) individu itu tidak pernah memiliki apa -apa harta kediaman\ntermasuk harta kediaman yang diperoleh secara pewarisan atau\npemberian, yang dipegang  sama ada secara individu atau\nbersesama.\n\n(2) Bagi maksud subperenggan (1), nilai harta kediaman hendaklah\nberdasarkan nilai pasaran.\n\n(3)  Permohonan bagi peremitan duti setem hendaklah disertakan dengan\nsurat akuan berkanun di bawah Akta Akuan Berkanun 1960 [ Akta 13 ] oleh individu\nyang disebut dalam subperenggan (1) yang mengesahkan bahawa individu itu tidak\npernah memiliki apa -apa harta kediam an termasuk harta kediaman yang diperoleh\nsecara pewarisan atau pemberian, yang d ipegang sama ada secara individu atau\nbersesama.\n\n(4)  Dalam perenggan ini—\n\n\"harta kediaman\" ertinya rumah, unit kondominium, pangsapuri atau\nrumah pangsa yang dibeli atau diperoleh semata-mata untuk digunakan sebagai\nrumah kediaman; dan\n\n  \"individu\" ertinya seorang pembeli atau pembeli bersama.\n\nDibuat 31 Disember 2014\n[Perb.CR(8.09)294/6/4-9(SJ.9)(2015);LHDN.01/35(S)/42/51/Klt.23;\nPN(PU2)159/XXXVIII]\n\nDATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI BIN MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\nMenteri Kewangan Kedua\n\nSTAMP ACT 1949\n\nSTAMP DUTY (REMISSION) (NO. 2) ORDER 2014\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 80(2) of the Stamp Act 1949\n[Act 378], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-10"};
