  FT["MY-H5040"] = {"id":"MY-H5040","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 362/2019&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2019年关税（反倾销税）（第2号）令","en":"CUSTOMS (ANTI-DUMPING DUTIES) (NO. 2) ORDER 2019","orig":"CUSTOMS (ANTI-DUMPING DUTIES) (NO. 2) ORDER 2019","ms":"Perintah Kastam (Duti Anti-Lambakan) (Bilangan 2) 2019","vi":"Lệnh về Hải quan (Thuế chống bán phá giá) (số 2) năm 2019","th":"คำสั่งศุลกากร (อากรตอบโต้การทุ่มตลาด) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2019","id":"Perintah Kepabeanan (Bea Masuk Anti-Dumping) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2019"},"level":"regulation","category":"03_涉外投资与贸易","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA362","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2019","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 5 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\03_涉外投资与贸易\\2019_P.U.(A)362-2019_CUSTOMS (ANTI-DUMPING DUTIES) (NO. 2) ORDER 2019.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H5040-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1.  (1)  Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kastam (Du ti Anti -Lambakan)\n(No. 2) 2019.\n\n (2) Perintah ini berkuat kuasa bagi tempoh lima tahun mulai 25 Disember 2019\nhingga 24 Disember 2024.\n\nDuti anti-lambakan"}},{"id":"MY-H5040-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Duti anti -lambakan hendaklah dilevi  terhadap dan dibayar oleh pengimport\nberkenaan dengan barang-barang yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (1) dan (2) Jadual yang\ndieksport dari negara yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (3) oleh pengeluar atau pengeksport\nyang dinyatakan dalam ruang (4 ) ke dalam Malaysia  pada kadar yang dinyatakan\ndalam ruang (5).\n\nPembayaran duti anti-lambakan"}},{"id":"MY-H5040-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Duti anti -lambakan yang kena dibayar di bawah Perintah ini hendaklah dibayar\nsecara tunai.\n\nPenjenisan barang-barang"}},{"id":"MY-H5040-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. (1) Penjenisan barang-barang yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual hendaklah mematuhi\nRukun Tafsiran Am Sistem Berharmonis di bawah Konvensyen Antarabangsa Sistem\nDeskripsi Komoditi Harmonis dan Pengkodan dalam Perintah Duti Kastam 2017\n[P.U. (A) 5/2017].\n\n (2) Nombor kepala atau subkepala  yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (1) Jadual\ndiperuntukkan bagi kemudahan rujukan dan tidak mempunyai kesan mengikat terhadap\npenjenisan barang-barang yang diperihalkan dalam ruang (2).\n\nKesan terhadap duti import dan cukai jualan"}},{"id":"MY-H5040-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5.  Pengenaan duti anti -lambakan di bawah P erintah ini tidaklah menjejaskan\npengenaan dan pemungutan—\n\n (a) duti import di bawah Akta Kastam 1967; dan\n\n(b) cukai jualan di bawah Akta Cukai Jualan 2018 [Akta 806].\n\nJADUAL\n\n[Perenggan 2]\n\nDUTI ANTI-LAMBAKAN\n\n(1) (2) (3) (4) (5)\nNombor\nKepala/\nSubkepala\nmengikut\nKod H.S.\n[Kod AHTN]\n\nPerihalan\nBarang-Barang\nNegara Pengeluar/Pengeksport\n\nKadar Duti\n[Peratusan\n(%) daripada\nNilai Kos,\nInsurans dan\nTambang\n(KIT)]\n\n7209.15.00 00\n7209.16.90 00\n7209.17.90 00\n7209.18.99 00\n\nBesi atau keluli\nbukan aloi\ngegelung\ngulungan sejuk,\ndengan kelebaran\nmelebihi 1300mm\ntidak termasuk\nplat hitam kilang\ntimah dan\ndagangan subjek\nyang diimport\nbagi maksud\npenggunaan akhir\nautomotif dan\nfinwall untuk\nRepublik\nRakyat\nChina\n\nJepun\n\nRepublik\nAngang Steel Company Limited\nMaanshan Iron and Steel Co., Ltd.\nShougang Jingtang United Iron &\nSteel Co., Ltd.\nLain-lain\n\nSemua pengeluar/pengeksport\n\nPOSCO\n4.82%\n4.76%\n8.74%\n\n26.38%\n\n26.39%\n\nNil\n\ntransformer Korea\n\nRepublik\nSosialis\nViet Nam\nLain-lain\n\nPOSCO Vietnam Company Limited\nLain-lain\n3.84%\n\n7.70%\n20.13%\n\nDibuat 18  Disember 2019\n[SULIT KE.HT(96)669/12-249 Klt.8 SK.15; MOF.TAX(S)700-4/1/217(25); PN(PU2)338D/III]\n\nLIM GUAN ENG\nMenteri Kewangan\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 11(2) Akta Kastam 1967]\n\nCOUNTERVAILING AND ANTI-DUMPING DUTIES ACT 1993\n AND\nCUSTOMS ACT 1967\n\nCUSTOMS (ANTI-DUMPING DUTIES) (NO. 2) ORDER 2019\n\nIN exercise of the p owers conferred by section 25  of the\nCountervailing and Anti -Dumping Duties Act 1993 [ Act 504 ] and subsection 11(1)\nof the Customs Act 1967 [Act 235], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n1. (1) This order may be cited as the Customs ( Anti-Dumping Duties) (No. 2)\nOrder 2019.\n\n(2)  This Order has effect for the period of five years from 25 December 2019\nto 24 December 2024.\n\nAnti-dumping duties\n2. Anti-dumping duties shall be levied on and paid by the importers in respect of\nthe goods specified in columns ( 1) and (2 ) of the Schedule exported from the countries\nspecified in column (3 ) by the producers or exporter s specified in colu mn (4 )\ninto Malaysia at the rates specified in column (5).\n\nPayment of anti-dumping duties\n3. The anti-dumping duties payable under this Order shall be paid in cash.\n\nClassification of goods\n4. (1) The classification of goods spe cified in the Schedule shall comply with\nthe General Rules for the Interpretation of the Harmonized System under the International\nConvention on the Harmonized Commodity Description and Coding System in the Customs\nDuties Order 2017 [P.U. (A) 5/2017].\n\n (2) The heading or subheading number s specified in column (1) of the Schedule\nare provided for ease of reference and have no binding effect on the classification of goods\ndescribed in column (2).\n\nEffect on import duties and sales tax\n5. The imposition of anti-dumping duties under this Order is without prejudice to the\nimposition and collection of—\n\n (a) import duties under the Customs Act 1967; and\n\n(b) sales tax under the Sales Tax Act 2018 [Act 806].\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n[Paragraph 2]\n\n ANTI-DUMPING DUTIES\n\n(1) (2) (3) (4) (5)\nHeading/\nSubheading\nNumber\naccording to\nH.S. Code\n[AHTN Code]\n\nDescription of\nGoods\nCountry Producer/Exporter Rate of duty\n[Percentage\n(%) of the\nCost,\nInsurance\nand Freight\n(CIF) Value]\n\n7209.15.00 00\n7209.16.90 00\n7209.17.90 00\n7209.18.99 00\nCold rolled\ncoils of iron or\nnon-alloy\nsteel, of width\nmore than\n1300mm\nexcluding tin\nmill black\nplate and\nsubject\nmerchandise\nimported for\nthe purpose of\nautomotive\nand finwall\nPeople's\nRepublic\nof China\n\nJapan\n\nRepublic\nof Korea\nAngang Steel Company Limited\nMaanshan Iron and Steel Co., Ltd.\nShougang Jingtang United Iron & Steel\nCo., Ltd.\nOthers\n\nAll producers/exporters\n\nPOSCO\nOthers\n4.82%\n4.76%\n8.74%\n\n26.38%\n\n26.39%\n\nNil\n3.84%\n\nfor\ntransformer\nend usage\nSosialist\nRepublic\nof  Viet\nNam\nPOSCO Vietnam Company Limited\nOthers\n7.70%\n20.13%\n\nMade 18 December 2019\n[SULIT KE.HT(96)669/12-249 Klt.8 SK.15; MOF.TAX(S)700-4/1/217(25); PN(PU2)338D/III]\n\n                                          LIM GUAN ENG\n                                           Minister of Finance\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to subsection 11(2) of the Customs Act 1967]"}}],"pack":"my-10"};
  FT["MY-H5041"] = {"id":"MY-H5041","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 362/2020&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2020年供应管制（管制物品）（第7号）令","en":"CONTROL OF SUPPLIES (CONTROLLED ARTICLES) (NO. 7) ORDER 2020","orig":"CONTROL OF SUPPLIES (CONTROLLED ARTICLES) (NO. 7) ORDER 2020","ms":"Perintah Kawalan Bekalan (Barang Kawalan) (Bilangan 7) 2020","vi":"Lệnh về Kiểm soát nguồn cung (Hàng hóa được kiểm soát) (số 7) năm 2020","th":"คำสั่งการควบคุมเสบียง (สิ่งของควบคุม) (ฉบับที่ 7) ค.ศ. 2020","id":"Perintah Pengendalian Persediaan (Barang yang Dikendalikan) (Nomor 7) Tahun 2020"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA362","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2020","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2020_P.U.(A)362-2020_CONTROL OF SUPPLIES (CONTROLLED ARTICLES) (NO. 7) ORDER 2020.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H5041-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kawalan Bekalan\n\n(Barang-Barang Kawalan) (No. 7) 2020.\n\nBarang-barang kawalan"}},{"id":"MY-H5041-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Barang-barang yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual diisytiharkan sebagai\n\nbarang-barang kawalan bagi tempoh mulai 22 Disember 2020\n\nhingga 31 Disember 2020.\n\nJADUAL\n\nBARANG-BARANG KAWALAN\n\n1. Daging kambing tempatan bertulang\n\n2. Daging kambing biri-biri import bertulang\n\n3. Ayam belanda import\n\n4. Tomato\n\n5. Lobak merah\n\n6. Kepak ayam\n\n7. Lada benggala hijau\n\n8. Kubis bulat import (Indonesia dan China, tidak termasuk kubis Beijing)\n\n9. Cili merah\n\n10. Babi hidup\n\n11. Daging babi (perut)\n\n12. Daging babi (daging dan lemak)\n\nDibuat 15 Disember 2020\n\n[KPDN(PGK)(S)0.5001/4 Jld. 8; PN(PU2)188/XII]\n\n DATO SRI ALEXANDER NANTA LINGGI\n\n Menteri Perdagangan Dalam Negeri\n\n dan Hal Ehwal Pengguna\n\nCONTROL OF SUPPLIES ACT 1961\n\nCONTROL OF SUPPLIES (CONTROLLED ARTICLES) (NO. 7) ORDER 2020\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 5 of the Control of Supplies Act 1961\n\n[Act 122], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation\n\n1. This order may be cited as the Control of Supplies (Controlled Articles)\n\n(No. 7) Order 2020.\n\nControlled articles\n\n2. The articles specified in the Schedule are declared to be controlled articles\n\nfor the period from 22 December 2020 to 31 December 2020.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nCONTROLLED ARTICLES\n\n1. Local bone-in mutton\n\n2. Imported bone-in mutton\n\n3. Imported turkey\n\n4. Tomato\n\n5. Carrot\n\n6. Chicken wing\n\n7. Green capsicum\n\n8. Imported round cabbage (Indonesia and China, not including Beijing\n\ncabbage)\n\n9. Red chili\n\n10. Live pig\n\n11. Pork (belly)\n\n12. Pork (lean and fat)\n\nD\n\nA\n\nT\n\nO\n\n'\n\nS\n\nR\n\nI\n\nH\n\nA\n\nS\n\nA\n\nN\n\nB\n\nI\n\nN\n\nM\n\nA\n\nL\n\nE\n\nK\n\nM\n\ne\n\nn\n\nt\n\ne\n\nr\n\ni\n\nP\n\ne\n\nr\n\nd\n\na\n\ng\n\na\n\nn\n\ng\n\na\n\nn\n\nD\n\na\n\nl\n\nMade 15 December 2020\n\n[KPDN(PGK)(S)0.5001/4 Jld. 8; PN(PU2)188/XII]\n\n DATO SRI ALEXANDER NANTA LINGGI\n\n Minister of Domestic Trade\n\n and Consumer Affairs"}}],"pack":"my-10"};
  FT["MY-H5042"] = {"id":"MY-H5042","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 362/2021&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2021年金融服务（豁免）（第4号）令","en":"FINANCIAL SERVICES (EXEMPTION) (NO. 4) ORDER 2021","orig":"FINANCIAL SERVICES (EXEMPTION) (NO. 4) ORDER 2021","ms":"Perintah Perkhidmatan Kewangan (Pengecualian) (Bilangan 4) 2021","vi":"Lệnh về Dịch vụ tài chính (Miễn trừ) (số 4) năm 2021","th":"คำสั่งบริการทางการเงิน (การยกเว้น) (ฉบับที่ 4) ค.ศ. 2021","id":"Perintah Jasa Keuangan (Pembebasan) (Nomor 4) Tahun 2021"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA362","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2021","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2021_P.U.(A)362-2021_FINANCIAL SERVICES (EXEMPTION) (NO. 4) ORDER 2021.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H5042-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Perkhidmatan Kewangan\n(Pengecualian) (No. 4) 2021.\n\n (2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Oktober 2021.\n\nPengecualian daripada subseksyen 17(1) dan seksyen 18"}},{"id":"MY-H5042-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1)  Suatu pengendali sistem pembayaran yang men yediakan perkhidmatan\npemeroleh saudagar dan  bukan peserta langsung suatu rangkaian instrumen\npembayaran dikecualikan daripada pemakaian subseksyen 17(1) dan seksyen 18 Akta.\n\n(2) Dalam Perintah ini , ‘‘peserta langsung''  ertinya anggota prinsipal\nsuatu rangkaian instrumen pembayaran  bagi maksud  menyediakan perkhidmatan\npemeroleh saudagar.\n\nDibuat 7 September 2021\n[MOF.SID(S)700-1/2/49(SK.1):BNM/JUN/1125/50/01; PN(PU2)718/Jld. 6]\n\nTENGKU DATUK SERI UTAMA ZAFRUL BIN TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ\n   Menteri Kewangan\n\nFINANCIAL SERVICES ACT 2013\n\nFINANCIAL SERVICES (EXEMPTION) (NO. 4) ORDER 2021\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 26 3 of the\nFinancial Services Act 2013 [Act 758], the Minister, on the recommendation of the Bank,\nmakes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-10"};
